    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425990/extras/66207789eef45d80a1eecff3bd282831.poster.avif?t=1736383673\" width=609 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425990/extras/66207789eef45d80a1eecff3bd282831.webm?t=1736383673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm keep is a turn based tactical RPG where you build and defend your settlement. You lead your colonists, plan battles, explore distant dungeons and destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Manage</strong>: Construct and expand your settlement, manage resources, and ensure your colonists thrive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Colonists</strong>: Command a group of unique colonists into the wild, each with their own abilities and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Dungeons</strong>: Travel to various dungeons, defeat monsters and uncover valuable loot to strengthen your settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Plan your moves carefully in grid-based tactical combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World</strong>: Encounter evolving challenges, Quests, new areas, and powerful enemies.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425990/extras/66207789eef45d80a1eecff3bd282831.poster.avif?t=1736383673\" width=609 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3425990/extras/66207789eef45d80a1eecff3bd282831.webm?t=1736383673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realm keep is a turn based tactical RPG where you build and defend your settlement. You lead your colonists, plan battles, explore distant dungeons and destroy them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Manage</strong>: Construct and expand your settlement, manage resources, and ensure your colonists thrive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lead Colonists</strong>: Command a group of unique colonists into the wild, each with their own abilities and personalities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore Dungeons</strong>: Travel to various dungeons, defeat monsters and uncover valuable loot to strengthen your settlement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong>: Plan your moves carefully in grid-based tactical combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World</strong>: Encounter evolving challenges, Quests, new areas, and powerful enemies.</p></li></ul>",
